---
title: Flow
description: Adds vertical rhythm by giving every child after the first a block-start margin. Set --flow-space on the container or any child to change the spacing locally. Use for prose and stacked content in normal flow.
tags: [layout, typography, css]
---

<link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css" media="screen">

<div class="flow">
  <h3>Heading</h3>
  <p>Paragraph one.</p>
  <p>Paragraph two.</p>
  <p style="--flow-space: 2rem">Paragraph with extra space above.</p>
</div>
